SUMMARY:Colloquium (Olivia Bailey\, UC Berkeley)
DESCRIPTION:Olivia Bailey (UC Berkeley) works on questions in moral psychology and the history of moral philosophy (particularly the British moralists). Her current research is concerned with the ethical and epistemic significance of empathy. \nMore details to follow.
